WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:04.079
Run Better Today
Keep running. Move smarter.

2
00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:09.501
Simple exercises that may help reduce
hip, knee and ankle discomfort.

3
00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:14.136
Start at an easy level.
Ease off if pain is more than mild.

4
00:00:14.186 --> 00:00:17.786
The routine builder checks
for warning signs first.

5
00:00:17.836 --> 00:00:21.420
Every exercise links to
its research source.

6
00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:25.877
Educational information only.
Not medical advice.

7
00:00:25.877 --> 00:00:28.499
If something feels wrong, stop.
